<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Kaman wins A$660 mln Australian copter deal.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Kaman wins A$660 mln Australian copter deal.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Defence Minister Ian McLachlan said on Thursday that Kaman Aerospace International, a unit of Kaman Corp, would provide 11 helicopters for the Royal Australian Navy under a A$660 million contract.</p>
</text>
